OL,3,GNEWSAFriends go the distance for family
OL,4,Aappeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fundraising campaign launched to help
OL,7,Fa seven-year-old girl with a rare
OL,8,Fdegenerative condition has exceeded its
OL,9,Ftarget.
OL,11,FFriends, family and strangers have
OL,12,Fraised more than #11,000 for Mabel,
OL,13,Ffrom Cleveleys in Lancashire, who has
OL,14,FBatten disease.
OL,16,FThe money will help the family buy a
OL,17,Fwheelchair-accessible van.
OL,19,FMabel's mother, Cheryl, said: "I'm so
OL,20,Fgrateful to my friends for their
OL,21,Fsupport and for all the help we've
OL,22,Freceived in the last three years."
